  "author_preprocessing": "NPQ pixel products and an integrated source-derived phenotypic table; RGB images and Micro-Tom NPQ images are omitted under the size limit. Supplied morphology/indices are already extracted, not instrument voltages.",
  "prior_analysis_and_limits": "The data accompany Image-based biomarkers effectively predict salt and drought stress in dwarf tomatoes. Metadata and main workbook use potentially inconsistent DAS/DAG definitions/order; retain both and reconcile from protocol before analysis. One cultivar has included images; metadata for the other is not missing imagery to invent. Tomato stress imaging reserve package; image-derived features require independent extraction and validation, not pixel-level random splits.",
